&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;"&gt;取得の対価&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;"&gt;現金&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;"&gt;83,400千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17.9pt;min-height:17.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;"&gt;取得原価&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;"&gt;83,400千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;４．主要な取得関連費用の内容及び金額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:14pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;アドバイザリー費用等　　2,000千円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;５．企業結合日に受け入れた資産及び引き受けた負債の額並びにその主な内訳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
